BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 711.0 Tm (A Spring Boot application that exposes disease statistics through a small REST API.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 697.0 Tm (   The project demonstrates Singleton, Adapter, Factory, Facade, and Chain of) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 683.0 Tm (   Responsibility patterns.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 663.0 Tm (Requirements) Tj ET
