BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 625.0 Tm (  - Internet access for the first Maven dependency download) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 611.0 Tm (  - Maven is not required globally; use the included Maven Wrapper) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 597.0 Tm (  - Postman for endpoint verification) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 577.0 Tm (The Spring Boot version and Java version are defined in pom.xml.) Tj ET
