BT /F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 261.0 Tm (Data Sources) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 237.0 Tm (The strategies use the fixture files supplied in src/main/resources:) Tj ET
