BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 203.0 Tm (  - JohnHopkins.json contains John Hopkins statistics.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 183.0 Tm (The source URLs are retained in src/main/resources/application.yml as configuration) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 169.0 Tm (   for the project specification. The current strategy implementations deserialize the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 155.0 Tm (   supplied fixture files so endpoint tests remain deterministic and do not depend on) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 141.0 Tm (   external service availability.) Tj ET
