BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 738.0 Tm (GetInstance\(\) creates the configured RestTemplate only when the static instance is) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 724.0 Tm (   absent. Later calls return the same object. Both disease strategies obtain their) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 710.0 Tm (   RestTemplate from this generator.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 690.0 Tm (2. Adapter: `IndianDiseaseStat`) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 666.0 Tm (Files:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 646.0 Tm (  - src/main/java/com/upgrad/patterns/Interfaces/IndianDiseaseStat.java) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 632.0 Tm (  - src/main/java/com/upgrad/patterns/Strategies/DiseaseShStrategy.java) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 618.0 Tm (  - src/main/java/com/upgrad/patterns/Strategies/JohnHopkinsStrategy.java) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 598.0 Tm (The interface gives both sources a common GetActiveCount\(\) contract even though their) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 584.0 Tm (   JSON structures differ.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 564.0 Tm (  - DiseaseShStrategy maps the disease.io response to a rounded count.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 550.0 Tm (  - JohnHopkinsStrategy filters India records, reads each confirmed count, and sums) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 536.0 Tm (     the results.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 516.0 Tm (3. Factory: `IndiaDiseaseStatFactory`) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 492.0 Tm (File: src/main/java/com/upgrad/patterns/Service/IndiaDiseaseStatFactory.java) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 472.0 Tm (GetInstance\(SourceType\) selects the appropriate IndianDiseaseStat implementation at) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 458.0 Tm (   runtime:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 438.0 Tm (  - SourceType.DiseaseSh selects DiseaseShStrategy.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 424.0 Tm (  - SourceType.JohnHopkins selects JohnHopkinsStrategy.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 410.0 Tm (  - An unsupported value raises IllegalArgumentException.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 390.0 Tm (4. Facade: `DiseaseCountFacade`) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 366.0 Tm (File: src/main/java/com/upgrad/patterns/Service/DiseaseCountFacade.java) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 346.0 Tm (The facade hides factory and strategy selection from the controller. It exposes simple) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 332.0 Tm (   methods for the two count endpoints and for infected-ratio calculation.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 312.0 Tm (5. Chain of Responsibility: Authentication) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 288.0 Tm (Files:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 268.0 Tm (  - src/main/java/com/upgrad/patterns/Authentication/Authenticator.java) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 254.0 Tm (  - src/main/java/com/upgrad/patterns/Middleware/AuthenticationProcessor.java) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 240.0 Tm (  - src/main/java/com/upgrad/patterns/Middleware/JwtAuthProcessor.java) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 226.0 Tm (  - src/main/java/com/upgrad/patterns/Middleware/BasicAuthProcessor.java) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 212.0 Tm (  - src/main/java/com/upgrad/patterns/Filters/AuthFilter.java) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 192.0 Tm (The chain is constructed as:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 172.0 Tm (JwtAuthProcessor to BasicAuthProcessor) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 154.0 Tm (JWT authentication is attempted first. A non-JWT provider is passed to Basic Auth. An) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 140.0 Tm (   invalid JWT is rejected rather than silently falling back to Basic Auth.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 126.0 Tm (The demo Basic Auth credentials are India / India; missing or incorrect credentials) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 112.0 Tm (   are rejected. This is assignment/demo authentication, not production credential) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 98.0 Tm (   management.) Tj ET
